# WDTT project

## Layout

```
pkg/           sharelink, vkhash, paneldb — shared by server + panel
server/        wdtt-server (go.mod: wdtt-server)
panel/         wdtt-panel (go.mod: wdtt-panel)
```

Data: `/etc/wdtt/panel.db` (SQLite schema v9). Server reads users/inbound via `pkg/paneldb`; panel owns xray + panel_config.

## Build

```bash
./build.sh amd64 server   # wdtt-server-linux-amd64
./build.sh amd64 panel    # wdtt-panel-linux-amd64
./build.sh amd64 all
```

Deploy: `systemctl stop wdtt` → copy binary → `systemctl start wdtt` (same for `wdtt-panel`).

## Refactor conventions

- New SQLite access → `pkg/paneldb` + thin adapters in `panel/paneldb_store.go` or `server/paneldb_store.go`
- Panel legacy API (`panel/api/server/*`) → delegate to native handlers / `api_ops.go`
- Minimal diffs; match existing naming and error shapes (`jsonOK` / `jsonMsg`)
- Commits: user asks explicitly; this env may need `git commit-tree` if `git commit` fails on `--trailer`

